{
  "id": "enad83339fce1faef5",
  "title": "Oh, The Deep Love of Jesus",
  "lyrics": [
    "Verse 1:",
    "1 verse:",
    "[F#m]O the d[C#]eep, [F#m]deep lo[C#]ve of[F#m] Jesus,",
    "[A]Vast, un[F#m]measured,[Bm] bound[C#]less, f[F#m]ree,",
    "[F#m]Rolling as [C#]a might[F#m]y ocean",
    "[A]In its[F#m] fullness[Bm] over[C#] me[F#m].",
    "",
    "Verse 2:",
    "[A]Underne[E]ath me,[F#m] all arou[C7]nd me,",
    "[F#m]Is the c[E]urrent o[D]f Thy l[C7]ove;",
    "[F#m]Leading o[C#]nwar[F#m]d, lead[C#]ing ho[F#m]meward",
    "[A]To m[E]y [F#m]glorio[D]us r[Bm]est a[C7]bov[F#m]e.",
    "",
    "Verse 3:",
    "2 verse:",
    "O the deep, deep love of Jesus,",
    "Spread His praise from shore to shore!",
    "How He loveth, ever loveth,",
    "Changeth never, nevermore!",
    "How He watcheth o'er His loved ones,",
    "Died to call them all His own;",
    "How for them He intercedeth,",
    "Watcheth o'er them from the throne.",
    "",
    "Verse 4:",
    "3 verse:",
    "O the deep, deep love of Jesus,",
    "Love of ev'ry love the best;",
    "'tis an ocean vast of blessing,",
    "'tis a haven sweet of rest.",
    "O the deep, deep love of Jesus,",
    "'tis heav'n of heav'ns to me;",
    "And it lifts me up to glory,",
    "For it lifts me up to Thee."
  ],
  "artist": "Simon Khorolskiy",
  "key": "F#m",
  "sourceMetadata": {
    "hymn_number": "3622"
  }
}
